{"time": 1756220920, "type": "recv", "message_id": "672555316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057832383", "user_id": "2039502134"}, "sender": {"id": "2039502134", "name": "清词"}, "message": "“不如先说说，你们想从我这知道什么”"}
{"time": 1756220937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "34683042", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057832383", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"姐姐到目前为止，还遇见了什么人吗？\"手指撑着脸颊，\"我可以提供其他人的。\""}
{"time": 1756221076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "248531930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057832383", "user_id": "2039502134"}, "sender": {"id": "2039502134", "name": "清词"}, "message": "“我想想哦…一个油腻腻的大胖子，一个棕头发妹妹，一个在街上大喊大叫的男人”"}
