{"time": 1756564578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1557542856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057832383", "user_id": "1067041556"}, "sender": {"id": "1067041556", "name": "虚幻过往"}, "message": "“先讲讲看，你都有什么能力”"}
{"time": 1756564878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1404713772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057832383", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我已经表明了职介，作为交换，不能只是我单方面付出吧？不然我如何确认你们的态度呢？\"语气比较无奈，\"只有真正合作之后，我们才可能坦诚彼此的能力。\""}
{"time": 1756564899, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1368080881", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057832383", "user_id": "1067041556"}, "sender": {"id": "1067041556", "name": "虚幻过往"}, "message": "“别忘了，现在是你们在求我们”"}
{"time": 1756565135, "type": "recv", "message_id": "520047330", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057832383", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我又不能确定，我们是否真的达成了合作，要是什么都说了却没达成合作，那对我是不是太不公平了。\""}
{"time": 1756565173, "type": "recv", "message_id": "467285355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057832383", "user_id": "1067041556"}, "sender": {"id": "1067041556", "name": "虚幻过往"}, "message": "“如果你只带了这种诚意来的话，那还是走吧”"}
{"time": 1756565188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "810491235", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057832383", "user_id": "1067041556"}, "sender": {"id": "1067041556", "name": "虚幻过往"}, "message": "“我们可没和西边的人结仇”"}
{"time": 1756565405, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1752465118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057832383", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你不妨问问其他的问题，而不是先探究我们之间的底线。\""}
{"time": 1756565497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "429427756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057832383", "user_id": "1067041556"}, "sender": {"id": "1067041556", "name": "虚幻过往"}, "message": "“如果连这种信息都不愿意告诉我们，那这种合作根本不可能成立”"}
